": "engenn5le04ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le04ob06re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn5le04ob06re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Johnson</span>: Hello?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Hello?  Mr. Johnson?<br /><span class =\"strong\">Mr. Johnson</span>: Hello Vanessa. How are you?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I'm fine, Mr. Johnson. A friend of mine is visiting from Cambridge. I'm calling to ask for a few days off in the next few days. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Johnson</span>: What do you mean by days off?", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le04ob06re2img10.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm hoping I can use some vacation time next week.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Johnson</span>: Well, Vanessa, you just started in your new position as sous-chef a few weeks ago.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yes, Mr. Johnson, but I have three weeks of vacation left.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Johnson</span>: You must earn those days off, Vanessa. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Could you be more explicit?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Johnson</span>: Well, you will have 3 weeks holiday at the end of your first year.", "time": "14500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le04ob06re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, I didn't realize that. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Johnson</span>: Yes, but your benefit plan allows you to take 3 personal days during the year.  You can use those days if your head chef agrees.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, thank you Mr. Johnson!  You're a great boss!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Johnson</span>:  I'm just a good manager.", "time": "35000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": 